By implementing comprehensive error handling, retry mechanisms, caching, health checks, and the circuit breaker pattern, you can significantly improve the uptime of your goal displays. These strategies will help you handle more edge cases and reduce downtime, bringing you closer to achieving 99.9% uptime.

